# kfar_arc.obj's export table (programs/fs/kfar/kfar_arc/kfar_arc.asm's
# EXPORTS, kfar_arc 0.17, kfar's plugin interface version 3), for
# tools/mkdll.py; lib_init first, as in KolibriOS for ARM's other
# libraries (kfar calls it before plugin_load: apps/kfar/tools.c). Not
# here: the zlib encoder the original links in from ../zlib/zlib.asm
# (deflateInit, deflateInit2, deflateReset, deflate, deflateEnd, zError,
# calc_crc32), which is not ported (docs/apps.md)
lib_init lib_init lib
version =3
plugin_load
OpenFilePlugin
ClosePlugin
ReadFolder
SetFolder
GetFiles
GetOpenPluginInfo
getattr mygetattr
open myopen
read myread
setpos mysetpos
close myclose
deflate_unpack
deflate_unpack2
